==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{ON.|is}} ''[[#Old Norse|ganga]]''.

===Verb===
'''ganga''' (''intransitive, strong conjugation:'' [[gekk]] – [[gengum]] – [[gengið]])

# to [[walk]]
# {{context|of machinery|lang=is}} to [[work]], [[operate]], [[run]]
#: '''Gengur''' klukkan? – ''Is the clock working?''
# to [[go]] (well or badly)
#: [[hreinsun|Hreinsunin]] '''gengur''' [[vel]]. – ''The cleaning is going well.''
# to [[fit]], be [[satisfactory]], [[do]]
#: [[halda|Heldurðu]] að þessi [[kjóll]] '''gangi''' ekki við [[rauður|rauðu]] [[kápa|kápuna]] [[minn|mína]]? – ''Don't you think this dress will fit in with my red coat?''

